<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - ERGO Q2 profit edges higher.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ERGO Q2 profit edges higher.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-June versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Available profit			  17.5 vs 17.4</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			 3,242 vs 3,281</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated	   12,629,000 vs 12,422,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			    0.26 vs 0.26</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  40,190 vs 38,057</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     51,768 vs 52,499</p>
<p>Full name: East Rand Gold and Uranium Co Ltd owned by Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
